# Video-as-Code Git Attributes
# Force LF normalization across all environments to guarantee cross-platform SHA-256 consistency
* text=auto eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
